These wallpapers come from the Omarchy matte-black theme
(https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/tree/63f60f4fcc4786d97e5c0384be640bcdef46f9a1/themes/matte-black/backgrounds).
WebP originals are converted to JPEG. Omarchy ships them under its MIT license
but does not name the original artists.

1-ship-at-sea.jpg: https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/commit/e5a1b994 (author not credited upstream)
2-dark-waters.jpg: renamed to 1-dark-waters.webp in https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/commit/a4219f8f; first commit not traced (author not credited upstream)
3-dot-hands.jpg: https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/commit/6b3fc343 (from https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy/issues/617; author not credited upstream)

